            "In-house asset rules applying to regulated superannuation funds Part 8",
            "Object and interpretation Division 1",
            "Section 69",
            "Part 8-In-house asset rules applying to regulated",
            "superannuation funds",
            "Division 1-Object and interpretation",
            "Subdivision A-General",
            "69 Object of Part",
            "The object of this Part is to set out rules about the level of the",
            "in-house assets of regulated superannuation funds.",
            "69A Sub-funds to be treated as funds.",
            "A sub-fund within a regulated superannuation fund is taken for the",
            "purposes of this Part to be a regulated superannuation fund if the",
            "sub-fund satisfies the following conditions:",
            "(a) the sub-fund has separately identifiable assets and separately",
            "identifiable beneficiaries; and",
            "(b) the interest of each beneficiary of the sub-fund is determined",
            "by reference only to the conditions governing that sub-fund.",
            "70A The Regulator may determine a person to be a standard",
            "employer-sponsor",
            "(1) For the purposes of this Part, the Regulator may determine in",
